      "content": "The calm is what worries me. If I stay, I just watch the edges blur. The music is so clear right now, but I know if I wait, the next few years will just be a slow, messy decline into nothingness. It feels almost disrespectful to the work itself to let it fade out into old age and forgetfulness. I keep thinking about how much more graceful it would be to just... exit while the resonance is still perfect. Like a performer leaving the stage during the standing ovation, rather than stumbling off in the dark.",
